---
import OrderFlow from './anim/OrderFlow.astro';
import Monitor from './anim/Monitor.astro';
---
<section id="faq">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <span class="sec-num">05</span>
    <h2>常見問題</h2>
    <span class="sec-note">/ 發案前先問清楚</span>
  </div>

  <div class="faq">
    <article class="faq-item">
      <h3 class="faq-q"><span class="faq-mark">Q</span>我不懂技術，要怎麼跟您溝通？</h3>
      <p class="faq-a">
        您不需要懂程式。訪談後您會拿到一份白話文流程圖，每個步驟做什麼、誰會收到通知都寫清楚，您確認後我才開始開發。
      </p>
      <figure class="faq-fig">
        <div class="anim-wrap">
          <OrderFlow />
          <!-- Phones only (hidden by CSS above 768px): the diagram sits still
               until this is tapped, then runs the timeline once. -->
          <button type="button" class="anim-play" aria-label="播放訂單流程動畫">
            <span class="anim-play-badge" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5.5 3.5v9l7-4.5z" /></svg></span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <figcaption>訪談後你會拿到的流程圖：每個步驟做什麼、誰會收到通知，一眼看完。</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </article>

    <article class="faq-item">
      <h3 class="faq-q"><span class="faq-mark">Q</span>系統上線後壞掉怎麼辦？</h3>
      <p class="faq-a">
        專案包含維護與監控。系統全天候自動檢查，一有異常就透過 LINE 和 Email 通知，通常我會比您先發現問題。
      </p>
      <figure class="faq-fig">
        <div class="anim-wrap">
          <Monitor />
          <button type="button" class="anim-play" aria-label="播放監控報錯動畫">
            <span class="anim-play-badge" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5.5 3.5v9l7-4.5z" /></svg></span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <figcaption>服務出狀況時，監控會比你先發現，並自動通報到 LINE 與 Email。</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
